        cActor[playerid][cLabelID] = Create3DTextLabel(string, 0xFFFFFFFF, cActor[playerid][cPos][0], cActor[playerid][cPos][1], cActor[playerid][cPos][2], 10.0, cActor[playerid][cWorld], 1);
        AtirouCorpo[playerid] = 0;
        //SetTimerEx("CriarCorpo", 3000, false, "i", playerid);
    }
    return 1;
}